From 84a84e163d62afc1150a720795c058c27d24e8e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:23:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): rework the page sidebar into a flat nav with a
 history toggle

- fold the history entry into the top action group
  (new chat / search / history / Agent manager / models)
- turn it into the upstream history toggle: on the history page the entry
  reads "Sessions" (chat.sessions) with a chat bubble icon and routes back
  to the active session list, otherwise it reads "History" with the clock
  icon and routes to hermes.history
- drop the single-chat/history conversation switch (tab grid), its CSS
  (including the dark-mode rule), the now-unused NTooltip import and
  openChat(), plus the sidebar.singleChat key in all 11 locales
---
